SHIPPED d2ae9c73 on the #243 DECLARED not-a-wrap path, the ELEVENTH consecutive wrap. It took
four runs and every refusal was the script working: the #208 reuse gate caught a msgfile whose
line 1 already carried a T3 prefix (this seat wrote the prefix by hand; the script adds it);
the #208 mention-map gate found knowledge/_graph-mention-map.json stale, regenerated it and
